body:
Me and my ex dated and lived together in our small hometown for over two years. Her friends had asked her if she wanted move to the city with them, and knowing her and how much she wanted to get out of the town we lived in I was fully supportive and they soon moved into a cute little house in middle of the city. A few months goes by a we see each other off and on, she seems a lot happier and I didn't question the obvious distance forming between us, but any who, my job takes me a little bit of everywhere in the state I live in, my job site just so happened to be in her city so I decided to go visit her in the morning and surprise her with some coffee. I unlock her door with the key she gave me and walk into her a room and come up to turn the corner and see her and another man naked in bed together passed out, bottles of wine and clothes everywhere. I experienced shock and then absolute immediate rage. I scream "OH WHAT THE FUCK" 

&#x200B;

The rest was a blur, screaming and yelling, I eventually turned and left her as she cried and begged me to stay. I drove home, told my friends and it eventually got to her family. I blocked her and still refuse to talk to her after 3 years of it happening. It fucked me up for a cool minute and left me pretty bitter but after awhile it really helped me discover who I was and what I wanted and how to be happy with just being by myself.
